WEBVTT

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:40.150
Tears are falling, so you are mine

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.610
- How do you make it?

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:35.680
Mizu, hurry up and make a wish!

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.020
Let's tell Uncle Jam about it!

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.220
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.490
Wow!

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.400
It's a shooting star!

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.880
It's beautiful!

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:08.710
Right?

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:09.970
Hmm...

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.460
It reminds me of something.

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:16.490
I've seen a shooting star that shines brighter than that before.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.310
Do you remember, Batako?

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.400
Yes!

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.800
I remember!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.910
It's the night Anpanman was born, right?

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.220
The night I was born?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.430
Yes.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:28.930
At that time...

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.290
I tried my best to make a living bread.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.780
I see. Anpanman.

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:23.610
Now, Batako.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:30.000
This child was born with the life of a star.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.300
*laughs*

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:30.610
Like it.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:08.160
I've been trying so hard to beat you up over and over again, but it's always just a matter of time before I get hurt.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.760
You're going to get hurt, aren't you?

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:16.240
Why? Why? I'm definitely stronger than you.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:20.810
That's probably because you have bread crumbs on you.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:27.270
And even if you get your face dirty, if you make a new face for Mr. Jam, you'll get better.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.760
Damn it!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:52.980
元気を出して頑張ればアンパンマンにはジャムおじさんがいる限りそうかよし見てろよアンパンマン今度こそやっつけてやるぞ

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.200
Octopus, help me with this after the anko is done.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:03.620
Yes.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:08.240
The kindergarten across the mountain is ordering a birthday bread.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.840
I'm thinking of making it an animal bread.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:14.890
That's wonderful! Let's add anko and chocolate.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:18.610
Hey, hey, don't eat the cheese.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:25.690
I'll make some cheese.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.830
Then, uncle, I'll go on a patrol.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.000
Oh, I'm counting on you.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.650
- That's it! - That's it!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:20.160
僕の顔をどうぞ。

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:37.790
Wow, it's a cute flower. It's like Melonpanna.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:43.850
I'm in a good mood again. It doesn't matter to the bread man. I'm sure he brought this for me.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:52.120
The flowers don't look good on you. This is for me. What? What doesn't look good on you?

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:56.050
Hey, Melonpanna, are you here? Hello.

00:07:56.050 --> 00:08:00.000
I brought flowers for Mr. Jam and Mr. Batako.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.600
Anpanman, it's a new face.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:21.290
Thank you, Uncle Jam!

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:23.730
Let's take a picture of this beautiful flower.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:24.550
I'll do it.

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:28.550
Anpanman, will you go deliver the bread to Yamamuko?

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:28.900
Yes!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.520
You're right. I have to hurry.

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:07.010
The old man?

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:08.010
The black cloud?

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:09.010
OK, let's follow him!

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:10.920
Wait, Anpanman!

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.410
I'll take you to the other side of the mountain.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:16.160
I'll let you know.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.080
Currypanman and Melonpanna are chasing the black cloud.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:19.910
Got it.

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:20.950
Let's go, Melonpanna!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:21.950
Yes!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.780
That's right.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:26.630
Follow me!

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:07.300
Ancora.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:11.220
I'm hungry. I want to eat anko.

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:18.680
Ancora hates spicy food.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:25.660
I don't want to eat anko. I want to eat anko.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.480
Wait, Ancora.

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.540
It would be nice to give you a delicious oshiruko, right?

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.540
What's this? I'm going to eat an oshiruko.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.540
Here you go.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.540
Here you go.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.540
Here you go.

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:50.610
Now, it's your turn. Hurry up!

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:51.920
Oshiruko-chan!

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:15.620
I'll give you a chance!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:22.260
I'm hungry too, Doki-chan!

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:24.500
Isn't that the right thing to do?

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:27.320
Baikinman, what are you going to do with me?

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:30.000
To defeat Pan-Man,

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.380
I'll have this old man disappear.

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.500
What?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:37.370
What will happen to Anpanman if his new face doesn't burn?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.320
Come on, Anpanman.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.290
This is your last chance.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.760
I've already lost sight of it.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.180
There's no doubt that it's a high school.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.470
I don't think I've been that far.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:07.300
Let's hurry.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.680
Yeah!

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:50.450
Let's start the operation!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.330
- Let's go! - Let's go!

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:53.270
Let's go!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.620
Do-Kin-Chan, that's not all you have to do.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.280
But I'm hungry!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:07.080
Shut up. Watch over Moji-san, okay?

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:14.510
I said I'm hungry.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.500
Do you want me to make something for you, Do-Kin-Chan?

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:18.770
Really?

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.370
If you have the ingredients, I'll bake you a delicious bread.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.520
I'm so happy! I'm so hungry!

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:35.760
Majika-chan, what are you doing in a place like this?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.450
and tie it around the end of the stick.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:27.780
Try it, Kin-chan.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.010
All you have to do is bake it.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:58.360
It's done.

00:14:58.360 --> 00:14:59.380
It's done.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.860
You're a Baikinman!

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:04.260
That's right, Anpanman!

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:07.800
If you want to save George-san, come and get me!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:08.540
What?

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.820
After all, you're the one who kidnapped George-san!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:14.630
Poon! Now I get it! Good job!

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:18.940
Only this genius Baikinman can do this!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.070
That's it!

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:24.420
Uwaaah!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.280
Uh-huh.

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:04.050
If you're going to do that, I'm going to sink you into the ocean!

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:16.180
Where are you going?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:30.000
I'm going to burn you!

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.380
Hey, everyone!

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:57.940
I thought I'd let you eat something delicious.

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.000
That's not the point.

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:03.320
- You're going to fight? - Stop it, Viking Man!

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:04.760
- Shut up! - Huh?

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:09.380
- Take Tojin to the next place. - Got it.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:11.020
Got it.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:15.360
- Kabilunrun and the others, let's go. - Okay.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.370
Bunbunman and the others?

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.680
Mr. Bunbunman!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:41.400
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.060
We'll be right back.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:35.220
I still have a fever. I shouldn't have gone far away.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:39.570
Anpanman, I can't find you anywhere on the island.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.580
Uncle, where are you?

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:47.150
Gin-chan, what are you doing in a hurry?

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:49.400
I'll know if you come, Savon-daman.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:52.470
Anyway, it has to be you.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:20:00.000
Is that so? But I'm sure...

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:04.560
Damn it! Where did the black spider go?

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:09.440
I'll catch up with you later, so please go ahead!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.440
I got it!

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:29.900
Manme, what are you doing?

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.880
It's okay, it's okay, leave it to me!

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:39.010
Shabondama!

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:42.010
I see, you just need to get rid of the dirt from that cloak.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.030
Okay! Leave it to me!

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:47.180
Good job, good job!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:49.800
Hmm...

00:20:49.800 --> 00:20:52.360
Clean, clean, clean, clean!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.360
Ah!

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:58.260
Ah!

00:20:58.260 --> 00:21:00.000
But, who is my...

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.300
It's Bokin-chan.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:15.340
There's no one else.

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:19.950
Everyone's looking for Mr. Jam.

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:24.500
I'm hungry.

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:27.500
I want to eat Mr. Jam's baked bread.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:30.000
Where's Mr. Jam?

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:40.210
Come back quickly in good health, Mr. Jam.

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:43.890
I wonder what he's doing these days, Mr. Jam.

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:45.180
It's okay.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:54.810
I'll find him with everyone's help.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:57.780
Please stay with me. I'm sure I'll save you.

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:46.140
Where are you going with everyone?

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:49.140
Didn't you see a strange black spider, Horror Man?

00:22:49.140 --> 00:22:50.290
Black spider?

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:51.530
Black spider?

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:53.560
Black spider.

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:55.490
I saw it. I saw it.

00:22:55.490 --> 00:22:57.540
I think I went the other way.

00:22:57.540 --> 00:22:58.260
What?

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:08.240
It's a desert all the way over there.

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:10.440
I can't see a single spider.

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:12.700
That's right, that's strange.

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:17.860
That black bear suddenly disappeared in the middle of the desert.

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:19.300
All right, no doubt.

00:23:19.300 --> 00:23:21.820
I have to hurry up and save my uncle.

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:22.280
That's right.

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:24.300
Wait a minute.

00:23:24.300 --> 00:23:27.150
What he's saying doesn't make sense.

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.550
It could be a trap.

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:30.000
Trap?

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:33.180
That's scary. I'm not lying, am I?

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:34.540
Anyway, let's go.

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:36.500
Maybe there's a clue.

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.300
That's right. Let's go.

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:40.480
All right, that's right.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:41.820
What?

00:23:41.820 --> 00:23:43.630
Be careful.

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:45.370
It seems like you did a good job.

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:48.990
Yes, I said as Doki said.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:52.380
If it's for Doki, it'll be of any use.

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:54.040
Don't forget it.

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:56.880
If it's for Doki, it'll be of any use.

00:23:56.880 --> 00:24:00.000
Anpanman and the others went that way.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:01.540
Yes.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:19.010
Sorry, sorry.

00:24:19.010 --> 00:24:24.980
Is this story a lie?

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:26.370
Of course, it is.

00:24:26.370 --> 00:24:29.720
I...

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:31.320
Where are you going?

00:25:06.590 --> 00:25:09.170
That means there's a real one somewhere, right?

00:25:09.170 --> 00:25:10.170
Yeah.

00:25:10.170 --> 00:25:11.170
That means there's a real one somewhere, right?

00:25:11.170 --> 00:25:12.170
That means there's a real one somewhere, right?

00:25:12.170 --> 00:25:13.160
Yeah.

00:25:56.430 --> 00:26:00.000
I'll punish you.

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:01.700
I won't forgive you.

00:26:01.700 --> 00:26:02.560
Who are you?

00:26:02.560 --> 00:26:03.680
You're an evil man!

00:26:03.680 --> 00:26:05.530
We didn't do anything!

00:26:05.530 --> 00:26:06.530
We just...

00:26:06.530 --> 00:26:30.000
I won't forgive those who talk about the desert.

00:26:30.090 --> 00:26:32.570
I won't forgive you. Go to hell!

00:26:32.570 --> 00:26:36.070
Suna-Otoko! We won't destroy the desert!

00:26:36.070 --> 00:26:39.520
We're looking for Mr. Jam who was kidnapped by Baikinman!

00:26:39.520 --> 00:26:43.160
You're lying. Baikinman didn't say that.

00:26:43.160 --> 00:26:47.410
You're being fooled! Do you believe what Baikinman says?

00:26:47.410 --> 00:26:48.560
Huh?

00:26:48.560 --> 00:26:49.650
Huh?

00:26:49.650 --> 00:26:56.560
Run!

00:27:12.220 --> 00:27:14.920
Bikinman, did you pay for the jam?

00:27:14.920 --> 00:27:15.970
Shut up!

00:27:15.970 --> 00:27:19.700
I don't care about that. I'm going to beat you to death!

00:27:19.700 --> 00:27:23.680
Anpanman, you're not here to destroy the desert, are you?

00:27:23.680 --> 00:27:26.740
Shut up! I don't have time for you!

00:27:26.740 --> 00:27:28.510
Bikinman!

00:27:28.510 --> 00:27:30.000
Get out of my way!

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:03.700
Aikinman, where is Uncle Jam?

00:29:03.700 --> 00:29:05.920
I don't know.

00:29:06.840 --> 00:29:08.420
Try to move a little bit.

00:29:08.420 --> 00:29:12.310
I'll make your face full of mold right away.

00:29:12.310 --> 00:29:13.670
Uncle Jam.

00:29:13.670 --> 00:29:14.550
Do you want to see me?

00:29:15.970 --> 00:29:19.910
At the end, I'll show you Uncle Jam's face only once.

00:29:24.070 --> 00:29:26.720
Drop the Dokin-chan Dokin-chan.

00:29:34.570 --> 00:29:40.680
Hello?

00:29:40.680 --> 00:29:43.120
-It's your turn. -Okay.

00:29:43.120 --> 00:29:45.880
Dogin, what are you doing?

00:29:45.880 --> 00:29:50.320
I was bored, so I was playing with Uncle Jam.

00:29:50.320 --> 00:29:51.280
What?

00:29:51.280 --> 00:29:54.480
I'm going to play with Uncle Jam.

00:29:54.480 --> 00:29:56.440
Look, Anpanman.

00:29:56.440 --> 00:29:57.810
Uncle Jam.

00:29:57.810 --> 00:30:00.000
Anpanman, I'm fine.

00:30:00.030 --> 00:30:01.490
You don't need to worry.

00:30:01.490 --> 00:30:03.790
Yes, yes, yes, yes, that's enough.

00:30:03.790 --> 00:30:07.250
Then give it back to Uncle Moji!

00:30:07.250 --> 00:30:09.920
I can't give it back.

00:30:09.920 --> 00:30:10.730
What?

00:30:10.730 --> 00:30:12.330
If you ask Uncle Moji,

00:30:12.330 --> 00:30:15.530
there's no one who can burn Anpanman's face again.

00:30:15.530 --> 00:30:16.730
What?

00:30:16.730 --> 00:30:19.840
Hufufufufufufufufufufufu

00:30:30.540 --> 00:30:32.160
I won't forgive you for that!

00:30:32.160 --> 00:30:35.060
You should be worried about yourself before that!

00:30:35.060 --> 00:30:35.990
Ouch!

00:30:35.990 --> 00:30:37.280
Kabi-bundan!

00:30:43.640 --> 00:30:44.820
Huh?

00:30:44.820 --> 00:30:45.430
Huh?

00:31:00.190 --> 00:31:03.990
Yo! You're late, but it seems like you could be of use to us!

00:31:03.990 --> 00:31:04.930
What?!

00:31:04.930 --> 00:31:23.200
I can't believe you showed up at this time!

00:31:48.460 --> 00:31:52.440
It's not too bad. Don't make me leave the desert.

00:31:52.440 --> 00:31:56.050
Anpanman, now is not the time!

00:32:07.320 --> 00:32:08.820
I'll crush you!

00:32:30.990 --> 00:32:35.470
Wait, this carpet will guide you.

00:32:35.470 --> 00:32:39.440
Anpanman, leave Currypanman to me.

00:32:39.440 --> 00:32:41.440
Hurry up and save Mr. Jam!

00:32:41.440 --> 00:32:42.440
I got it!

00:32:42.440 --> 00:32:43.440
I'm going!

00:32:43.440 --> 00:32:44.260
Okay!

00:33:34.510 --> 00:33:37.650
Gin-chan, spin the wheel as hard as you can!

00:34:00.160 --> 00:34:02.340
Is it okay if I go this way?

00:34:02.340 --> 00:34:05.570
Hurry up! The jam man is in trouble!

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:35.270
何?

00:34:35.270 --> 00:34:39.960
パナちゃんがんばれ!

00:34:39.960 --> 00:34:59.890
ポンポン!

00:35:00.860 --> 00:35:02.420
- Hey!

00:35:02.420 --> 00:35:03.240
- Hey!

00:35:03.240 --> 00:35:12.260
- Huh?

00:35:12.260 --> 00:35:14.340
- No, no, no, no, no!

00:35:30.190 --> 00:35:31.600
That's tough.

00:35:31.600 --> 00:35:35.610
Doki-chan, Doki-chan, this is Baikinman.

00:35:35.610 --> 00:35:38.830
- Yes. - Let's start Operation B.

00:35:38.830 --> 00:35:40.330
Let's do this.

00:35:40.330 --> 00:35:41.470
Operation B of Jam.

00:35:41.470 --> 00:35:43.670
Target point, Shindou-kei.

00:35:43.670 --> 00:35:51.060
- Kei? - Yuki?

00:36:15.130 --> 00:36:17.380
Uncle, you have to be quiet.

00:36:17.380 --> 00:36:22.020
Dokyung, what are you going to do by bringing me to a place like this?

00:36:22.020 --> 00:36:25.890
I'll give you an umbrella if you put it on.

00:36:33.450 --> 00:36:35.670
Anpanman, stay safe.

00:36:35.670 --> 00:36:41.320
Where did Uncle Yamo take us?

00:36:41.320 --> 00:36:43.110
I can't find him at all.

00:36:43.110 --> 00:36:46.480
Hey, Mr. Magic Coat, don't you know?

00:36:46.480 --> 00:36:48.450
I see.

00:36:48.450 --> 00:36:52.790
We're in trouble. Which way should we go?

00:36:52.790 --> 00:36:54.660
Yuki! Yuki!

00:36:54.660 --> 00:36:57.040
It's the Snowman and the others!

00:37:01.080 --> 00:37:03.720
There's a ship that I've never seen in the cave?

00:37:03.720 --> 00:37:04.870
Yuki! Yuki!

00:37:04.870 --> 00:37:06.870
Then I'm sure it's Uncle Mo!

00:37:06.870 --> 00:37:08.110
All right! Let's go!

00:37:08.110 --> 00:37:08.770
Yuki! Yuki!

00:37:08.770 --> 00:37:21.450
That ship!

00:37:21.450 --> 00:37:22.660
Uncle Mo...

00:37:22.660 --> 00:37:24.130
-Let's go! -Okay!

00:37:33.230 --> 00:37:34.810
I won't let you get away with this.

00:37:34.810 --> 00:37:35.770
What?

00:37:51.280 --> 00:37:55.090
Are you okay?

00:38:30.030 --> 00:38:32.440
I want to watch it again!

00:38:32.440 --> 00:38:39.810
This is the last one!

00:38:39.810 --> 00:38:41.760
I'll make your head into a comb!

00:39:10.970 --> 00:39:13.720
You're so annoying!

00:39:22.390 --> 00:39:24.390
Let's clean this up together!

00:41:01.690 --> 00:41:10.610
It's okay if it's about me! Don't worry and fight as hard as you can!

00:41:10.610 --> 00:41:13.490
Alright! Let's go, Melonpanna-chan!

00:41:18.010 --> 00:41:18.720
Ah!

00:41:31.820 --> 00:41:35.710
Kefu! Appa-man, try taking my sword!

00:41:35.710 --> 00:41:36.700
What?

00:41:36.700 --> 00:41:37.720
Huh?

00:41:49.470 --> 00:41:50.930
What?

00:42:10.460 --> 00:42:14.760
「よく来てくれたね」

00:43:10.170 --> 00:43:11.430
It's all thanks to you.

00:43:11.430 --> 00:43:14.080
Let's go home and bake some bread.

00:43:14.080 --> 00:43:18.080
We're all waiting for Mr. Jam's delicious bread.

00:43:18.080 --> 00:43:24.580
Gin-chan.

00:43:24.580 --> 00:43:30.000
I'll make you smile.

00:43:30.920 --> 00:43:31.380
Bye-bye!

00:44:00.700 --> 00:44:03.270
I'll answer you, bye bye
